      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I DON'T WANT THIS!!! I don't want my dead friend's name to be taken up by anyone!! If I could I'd downvote this in a heartbeat. I don't care if the name is taken or not, then it's taken. First come first served. \nHere's a solution! Make a system like discords #0000 tags! Make a post about that so I can keep my friend at least in my friends list! No account wipe but you'll still get the name you want!!\nVRchat devs, I beg of you not to wipe \"inactive accounts\" to preserve the memories of those who'll never be able to log in again.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
