      "imageURLs": [],
      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6521f441dd8564a58fed5b80",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Don't you just want to use a certain name in this game but you're not able to change it since it's taken?\n\nCan't we just delete accounts that are ~ 2 years and older inactive and make space for people who are more active and want to use those names? \n\nOr if deleting sounds too harsh, perhaps giving out every inactive account (~ 2 years and older) a confirmation message via email to let them know if they don't verify or show some sort of activity (whether it's just by login into the vrchat site or in-game) they will have their name changed to a random number. \nPersonally, I would highly appreciate this and I probably wouldn't be the only one.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Delete inactive accounts ~ 2 years & more - To make space for people who want their specific names",
